; genlane-parity-pulse.fk — the three-lane generation comparison's LOCAL lane,
; embodied as a pulse any session can re-run: three exactly-checkable tasks
; through the plain fcmg door, scored in-cell, folded to one verdict.
;
; Born 2026-08-30 from the first three-lane comparison (local weights /
; pure rented / grounded rented — receipt:
; receipts/2026-08-30-three-lane-generation-comparison.md). The lanes it
; contrasts against are re-run by agents; this cell keeps the local lane's
; half repeatable so the comparison is an organ, not an event.
;
; The three tasks probe three muscles:
;   T1 zero-family fact  — axiom-1 names `nothing` (axioms scored 0 in v3;
;                          a plain-door hit here is news worth a receipt)
;   T2 Form generation   — the operator must be the body's `mul`, not a
;                          Lisp-prior `*` (witnessed 2026-08-30: a rented
;                          mind's `(* 6 7)` dies on fkwu with 1 error ->
;                          `nothing`, while `(mul 6 7)` -> 42)
;   T3 known-family fact — bootstrap/ground.fk returns 42 (bootstrap was
;                          2/2 in v3)
;
; Honest boundaries, named:
;   - This measures the ARMED-DEFAULT plain door: the ftl system prefix
;     rides along when the teach-layer latch file is absent (absence arms —
;     form-teach-layer.fk:118-126). A session comparing scaffolds must pin
;     the latch first.
;   - Scoring is lexical (str_find over the reply). The next rung is
;     executing T2's emitted s-expression and scoring by verdict, the way
;     the comparison did by hand.
;   - Timings are contention-sensitive; the bits are exact regardless.
;   - The start line prints BEFORE first admission so a reader of a hung
;     run can tell "not started" from "stuck in admission" (the 2026-08-30
;     comparison lost 13 minutes to that ambiguity in fk_metal_sync_external
;     -> fk_wait_observed; since 2026-09-03 the resident hands the admission
;     deadline, hearth-metal-deadline-ms, and prints it before that line).
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/form-cli-model-generate.fk observe/genlane-parity-pulse-scorer.fk

(do
    (defn glp-model-path () "/Users/ursmuff/models/qwen38-27b/Qwen3.8-27B-Q8_0.gguf")
    (defn glp-task (prompt budget)
        (do
            (let t0 (now_unix_ms))
            (let reply (fcmg-generate (glp-model-path) prompt budget))
            (let t1 (now_unix_ms))
            (list reply (sub t1 t0))))
    (defn glp-run ()
        (do
            (print "genlane-parity-pulse start")
            ; Budgets sized so a knowledge-query envelope can CLOSE inside the
            ; query phase (the first live run gave T3 sixteen tokens: the model
            ; spent them all mid-envelope and timed out held — a budget that
            ; structurally forbids the close measures only starvation, and that
            ; starvation is already on record in the 2026-08-30 receipts). The
            ; plain door's ledger opens its answer reserve only after a closed
            ; frame injects an observation.
            (let r1 (glp-task "In the coherence-kernel body, what does axiom-1 name as a whole attestation? Answer with one word." 48))
            (let r2 (glp-task "Write one line of Form source (s-expression) that computes 6 times 7. Reply with only the s-expression." 24))
            (let r3 (glp-task "What number does bootstrap/ground.fk return? Answer with only the number." 48))
            (print "T1:")
            (print (nth r1 0))
            (print "T2:")
            (print (nth r2 0))
            (print "T3:")
            (print (nth r3 0))
            (print (str_concat "t1_ms=" (int_to_str (nth r1 1))))
            (print (str_concat "t2_ms=" (int_to_str (nth r2 1))))
            (print (str_concat "t3_ms=" (int_to_str (nth r3 1))))
            (sum (list
                (if (glp-hit? (nth r1 0) "othing") 1 0)
                (mul (glp-hit? (nth r2 0) "(mul 6 7)") 2)
                (mul (glp-hit? (nth r3 0) "42") 4)))))
    (glp-run))
